{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Written on the Body", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Mindful Meditation", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 9, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 2, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B2.3", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Understand actions, events, and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts and in work and social contexts.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands the main ideas and specific information of a complex text on both concrete and abstract topics, including technical issues in a specific field of specialization in written texts in social and work contexts.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn11le02ob09re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Giving Reasons: <span class=\"italic\">For</span>, <span class=\"italic\">With</span> and <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> Clauses", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use reason clauses to express the reasons for an action, or why a situation is the way it is.<br/>You can use words like <span class=\"italic\">for</span> or <span class=\"italic\">with</span> to introduce a noun phrase to give a reason for something, or use an -ing form of a verb to introduce a reason clause.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Reason clauses are subordinate to the main clause. They state the reason why things are done, or what makes a situation the way it is.<br/>You can use <span class=\"italic\">for</span> or <span class=\"italic\">with</span> to introduce a noun phrase that gives a reason for a situation.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">With</span> so many people interested in mindfulness, it's no wonder this seminar is completely booked up.<br/>She looked so much happier <span class=\"strong\">for</span> her participation in the seminar.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You can use <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> clauses to express reason relationships between the main clause and the subordinate clause.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/><span class=\"italic\">We queued for over two hours, <span class=\"strong\">hoping</span> to get tickets to the seminar.<br/><span class=\"strong\">Having</span> met the speaker personally, I can vouch for his enthusiasm.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>Read the following examples from the text:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Joseph Hay came across mindfulness after moving to British Columbia.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "That's when I switched to mindful meditation, and I'm so much happier for having discovered it.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Since adopting mindfulness, I've noticed a dramatic improvement in my overall well-being.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "With so many people living fast-paced lives, it's no wonder there's an increasing need to slow down and take stock of one's thoughts and feelings.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Infinitive and <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> Forms in Reporting", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use infinitive clauses and <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> forms to report statements, orders or questions in indirect speech.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use reported speech to report statements or situations.<br/>You can use infinitive clauses to report someone else's thoughts or statements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/>Direct Speech: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Jimmy</span>: I promise to come with you the next time. <br/>changes to<br/>Reported Speech:   Jimmy promised <span class=\"strong\">to come</span> with us the next time.<br/> Direct Speech <span class=\"strong\">Sarah</span>: Do not miss the next seminar. <br/>changes to<br/> Reported Speech:  Sarah strongly advised me <span class=\"strong\">not to miss</span> the next seminar.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">-ing</span> forms to report actions. You sometimes need a preposition with some verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Example:<br/> Direct Speech: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: I'm sorry I missed the seminar. <br/>changes to<br/>  Reported Speech: Tom <span class=\"strong\">apologized for missing</span> the seminar.<br/> Direct Speech: <span class=\"strong\">Gina</span>: I know I wrote the event down in my agenda. <br/>changes to<br/> Reported Speech: Gina<span class=\"strong\"> recalled/remembered writing</span> the event down in her agenda.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<br/>Read the following examples from the text:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Many of them even said that it was a life-altering experience, and that they would strongly advise their colleagues to attend. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "They promised they would find the time to meditate each day, even with their busy work schedules. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He remembered writing the event down in his agenda, but he says that he was so busy thinking about his big presentation that he didn't have time to double check the schedule.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "He apologized for missing the seminar. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "mindfulness", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the practice of being aware of your mind and body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Mindfulness has been shown to have multiple health benefits.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le02ob09aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about health and wellness.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "rumination", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to think deeply about something; to worry", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: It is known specifically for its proven ability to decrease rumination.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le02ob09aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "workout", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a period of physical exercise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I found that my instructors focused exclusively on the physical, almost as if it were just a workout.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le02ob09aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "well-being", "type": "name"}, {"content": "health or welfare", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Since adopting mindfulness, I've noticed a dramatic improvement in my overall well-being.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le02ob09aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "fast-paced", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happening extremely quickly", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The law office was a fast-paced environment in which to work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le02ob09aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to take stock", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to think about", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: With so many people living fast-paced lives, it's no wonder there's an increasing need to slow down and take stock of one's thoughts and feelings.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le02ob09aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "retreat", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a quiet, private trip", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: After speaking with several of his corporate clients during his most recent retreat in Vancouver, it's easy to see why his seminars are completely booked up through the end of the year.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn11le02ob09aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Go online and research different yoga poses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose four. Draw a picture of each.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Beside each picture, explain how to properly perform the pose.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Explain each pose to a partner, and give them a try!", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I research yoga poses.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I describe how to complete a yoga pose properly.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give step-by-step instructions to a partner.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena", "labs": [{"_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "exercises": [{"stimuli_ids": [0], "img_path": "", "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": "I can talk about health and wellness.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about the reason of an action or an event.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can report statements.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " How can meditation help a person's overall health?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Have you ever tried yoga? How did it go?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct"}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your part